<title>USA: Community First increases note offering.</title>
<headline>Community First increases note offering.</headline>
<dateline>FARGO, N.D. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Community First Bankshares Inc said Tuesday it increased its offering of 7.30 percent subordinated notes due 2004 to $60 million from $50 million.</p>
<p>The company also said the private offering was completed.</p>
<p>Community First said it plans to use the net proceeds from the offering to fund a portion of the estimated $135 million purchase price for its proposed acquisition of KeyBank National Association in Cheyenne, Wyoming.</p>
<p>Community First shares rose 11/16 to 37-1/16.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
